    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/bd0cbd6028f4b03893e17b38c3bc23e2.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Fleet is a 2D sci-fi real-time strategy, puzzler, fleet management, autobattler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're getting a part of rebellion against the Empire and want to make a name for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Project Fleet, you raid one planet after another in roguelite style. However, the enemies won't make it easy and will try to stop you. You're also constantly on the run from the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make a name for yourself, trade with NPCs, and expand your base and hangar! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ad16888f0c46064dc55093e4cfddd6c8.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Spaceships you equipped in your Hangar onto the Gridbased Battlefield. Formations bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.poster.avif?t=1754064438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.webm?t=1754064438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.mp4?t=1754064438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four classes: Gatherers, Fighters, Supporters and the Factory. Each class brings its own abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gatherers</strong> increase your shield. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fighters</strong> use shield energy to attack the enemy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Supporters</strong> are slow attackers without\u00a0</i>additional cost<i>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Factories</i></strong><i>\u00a0use shield energy, produce money and collect resources.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six levels of planets <i>(12 different planets in total)</i> to conquer and their resources to plunder. Each level becomes more difficult than the one before it. There are also numerous events to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/5e35d510945273ecf0617922f819ed91.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story Mode and Highscore Mode with online leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 different Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Numerous Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-28 Spaceships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-14 unique Soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 Traders and Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-different PowerUps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-different Base Expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-a unique Gameplay</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/bd0cbd6028f4b03893e17b38c3bc23e2.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Fleet is a 2D sci-fi real-time strategy, puzzler, fleet management, autobattler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're getting a part of rebellion against the Empire and want to make a name for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Project Fleet, you raid one planet after another in roguelite style. However, the enemies won't make it easy and will try to stop you. You're also constantly on the run from the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make a name for yourself, trade with NPCs, and expand your base and hangar! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ad16888f0c46064dc55093e4cfddd6c8.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Spaceships you equipped in your Hangar onto the Gridbased Battlefield. Formations bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.poster.avif?t=1754064438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.webm?t=1754064438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/11d85867c085500165fcfad2d8d2a036.mp4?t=1754064438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four classes: Gatherers, Fighters, Supporters and the Factory. Each class brings its own abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gatherers</strong> increase your shield. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fighters</strong> use shield energy to attack the enemy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Supporters</strong> are slow attackers without\u00a0</i>additional cost<i>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Factories</i></strong><i>\u00a0use shield energy, produce money and collect resources.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six levels of planets <i>(12 different planets in total)</i> to conquer and their resources to plunder. Each level becomes more difficult than the one before it. There are also numerous events to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/5e35d510945273ecf0617922f819ed91.avif?t=1754064438\" width=400 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story Mode and Highscore Mode with online leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 different Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Numerous Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-28 Spaceships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-14 unique Soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 Traders and Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-different PowerUps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-different Base Expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-a unique Gameplay</p>",
    "short_description": "Project Fleet is a 2D Sci-Fi real-time strategy, puzzler, fleet managment, autobattler in a roguelite style. Trade with NPCs, expand your base and hangar. Launch expeditions to the 12 available planets or compete with other players worldwide in Highscore-Mode",
